  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220ºC/200ºC fan-forced.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Chop cauliflower (including stalk!) into small florets.\n• Place cauliflower on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with chermoula spice blend, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then roast until tender and brown around edges, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686499aab3c183c7dd037026/step-c0de0300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice brown onion (see ingredients).\n• Roughly chop cucumber and roasted almonds. Finely chop garlic. Drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a small microwave-safe bowl, combine half the garlic and a drizzle of olive oil. Microwave in 10 second bursts, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt to garlic oil, stirring to combine. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686499aab3c183c7dd037026/step-b8709710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook brown onion, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add the remaining garlic and lentils and cook, stirring until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686499aab3c183c7dd037026/step-d3123420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the pan with lentils, add the water and vegetable stock and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous, stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until the water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686499aab3c183c7dd037026/step-c7dd6630.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• In a medium bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, cucumber and a drizzle of olive oil and white wine vinegar. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686499aab3c183c7dd037026/step-a26de440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide spiced lentil-couscous between bowls.\n• Top with salad, haloumi and roasted cauliflower.\n• Drizzle over Greek-style yoghurt. Sprinkle over roasted almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686499aab3c183c7dd037026/step-992abf50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
